### DevOps Monitoring Endpoints Test

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Get Comprehensive Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/devops/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get Detailed Health Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/devops/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get Recent Error Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/devops/logs?limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Basic Health Check (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Readiness Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
Content-Type: application/json
